      "writtenOn": "2023-02-03T20:21:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re going to need to keep the deferred checks for the BC1.2 interrupt to deal with race condition of both the TCPC and BC1.2 chips generating interrupts back to back.\n\nThe TCPC ISR already does polling to determine if the interrupt is still active using the `tcpc_get_alert_status()`.  So the deferred calls only need to run `usb_charger_task_set_event()`.",
